    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i get that, but i really dont have time for a doctors appointment right now. it's just been happening for like a week and it always goes away on its own after a few minutes so it doesn't feel like an emergency. do u think it's more likely just the lack of sleep and stress? i've been hitting the caffeine pretty hard to keep up with work, could that be causing it too?",
